  "body": "This pull request adds the demo code (199 files) on top of the licence, README and security policy.\n\nWhat it is: a small lead desk that takes the same lead from two forms, a retry or a crash and keeps exactly one record and one follow-up. It runs on made-up data with stand-in programs for the CRM, the mail system and the AI step, so nothing real is sent.\n\nWhat to look at first: `README.md` (how to run it and what is claimed), `docs/limits.md` (what is not claimed), `contract.md` (the exact behaviour), `docs/tests.md` (how the checks run).\n\nChecks that run on this pull request: the lint workflow (ruff, mypy, bandit, a secret scan, the full test run) and CodeQL. CodeRabbit and Sonar run if their apps are installed on the repository.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
